{"parse":{"title":"78th Venice International Film Festival","pageid":66395538,"revid":1373556517,"text":{"*":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"In_Competition\">In Competition</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=78th_Venice_International_Film_Festival&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: In Competition\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=78th_Venice_International_Film_Festival&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: In Competition\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>The following films were selected for the main competition:<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:95%; margin-bottom:2px\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>English title\n</th>\n<th>Original title\n</th>\n<th>Director(s)\n</th>\n<th>Production country\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/America_Latina_(film)\" title=\"America Latina (film)\">America Latina</a></i></td>\n<td data-sort-value=\"D&#39;Innocenzo\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damiano_and_Fabio_D%27Innocenzo\" title=\"Damiano and Fabio D&#39;Innocenzo\">Damiano D'Innocenzo and Fabio D'Innocenzo</a></td>\n<td>Italy\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><a href=\"/wiki/Another_World_(2021_film)\" title=\"Another World (2021 film)\">Another World</a></i></td>\n<td><i>Un autre monde</i></td>\n<td data-sort-value=\"Briz\u00e9\"><a href=\"/wiki/St%C3%A9phane_Briz%C3%A9\" title=\"St\u00e9phane Briz\u00e9\">St\u00e9phane Briz\u00e9</a></td>\n<td>France\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Box_(2021_Venezuelan_film)\" titl